      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب خطر مشخصی برای بارداری ذکر نکرده یا داده کافی ندارد؛ فقط در صورت لزوم و با نظر پزشک.",
        "en": "Label states no clear risk or has limited data; use only if needed, under medical advice."
      },
      "quote": "Risk Summary There are no adequate data on the developmental risk associated with the use of pramipexole dihydrochloride tablets in pregnant women.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-pramipexole",
          "section": "8.1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "lactation": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در شیردهی با احتیاط؛ متن برچسب را ببینید.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Risk Summary There are no data on the presence of pramipexole in human milk, the effects of pramipexole on the breastfed infant, or the effects of pramipexole on milk production.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-pramipexole",
          "section": "8.2"
        }
      ]
    },
