        "en": "Label: use with caution in older adults, usually starting at the low end of the dose range."
      },
      "quote": "Pramipexole total oral clearance is approximately 30% lower in subjects older than 65 years compared with younger subjects, because of a decline in pramipexole renal clearance due to an age-related reduction in renal function.",
